@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Admin" as U
participant "Admin Console" as C
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Supabase" as S
participant "Activity Log" as L

U -> C: Enter username, password and role
C -> A: POST /api/admin/admins
A -> S: adminUsers.createAdminUser(...)
S --> A: created user
A -> L: record admin_user.created
A --> C: 201 user
C --> U: Show in admin list
note over S: Passwords are hashed before insert, duplicate usernames return 409.
@enduml
